        "id": 121524,
        "name": "Nataraja",
        "username": "Nataraja",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/7feea3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-11-28T09:32:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We already know that cards don't get destroyed until they have done all their text reads; we also know that triggered abilities resolve before going on with resolving the triggering card</p><p>So I'd read the substitution effect of \"put it under the Dreamer instead\" as something that happens at the very end of card destruction resolution, meaning TA has time to destroy an equipment before leaving play</p>",
